{
  "_note": "Story 2 Die Frostgruft on the Hell-Dungeon runtime (src/hell/hell_game.gd, theme_path). Keys override THEME_DEFAULT there. weapon_scale: held weapons and arrows (smaller than the hero, sits in the hand). classes: hero per class (menu choice, class_id): sprite (0x72 name), hp (half hearts), speed (px/s) and weapon (melee: damage per hit, cooldown s, reach px, arc rad; projectile: damage, cooldown s, speed px/s, life s, shot arrow/magic, splash px radius). Values are the main game's (src/data/balance.json) scaled to this world (about x2.4). liquid: what grid cell 2 is (frost: glaze ice, hurt false, slow 1 = full speed, slide true, grip = share of the old speed left after one second). keys: name, hint, minimap colour, tint and skin sprite per key. words: hell phrase -> frost phrase, applied to toasts, prompts and end texts (longest first). colors: see THEME_DEFAULT. mobs: enemy kinds by id (name, sprite = skin name, with frames > 1 the prefix of _f0.._fN, fps, hp, speed px/s, radius px, behavior chase / shooter (keep_away px, fire_every s, shot_speed px/s) / dasher (dash_every s, dash_speed px/s, dash_time s) / puller (pull_radius px, pull px/s) / shield (shield_arc rad, blocks hits from the front) / turret (fire_every s, fan shots, spread rad, shot_speed), chill = s the hero is slowed after a touch, split = {into, count} on death). roster: kinds per room by floor (from = first floor, weight). bosses: guardian look per floor (sprite, frames, fps, scale); boss_adds: kinds the guardian summons. chill_speed: speed factor while chilled (ice zombie touch). boss_kits: guardians with their own fight per floor: phases (share of the floor boss hp, or hp list), every = s between attacks, title = toast on entering, look/tint = new look, guard = damage factor while its summoned crystals stand, storm = darker room, last_stand = below share: safe circles, then rest s with rest_damage factor; attacks do = summon(kind,count,around,guard) / ring(count,speed,chill) / fan(count,spread rad,speed,chill) / stomp(rings,count,gap rad,speed,pause s) / breath(duration,turn rad,rate s,speed,chill) / spiral(arms,duration,rate,speed) / charge(speed,time,windup) / icicles(count,radius,delay,spread px) / teleport_center(windup,push px) / fist(speed,back s) / fist_hunt(count,time,speed) / chill_zones(count,radius,time). Guardians with a kit take no knockback. phase_break: s invulnerable, push px and a shard ring between phases. mobs exp: experience per kill; material: bone/flesh/void for hit and kill sounds. leveling: need(level) = base * level^exponent experience, heal half hearts on level-up, boss_exp for guardians (mini = floors 3/6/9), skills = the class skills (hero_skills.json; distances x scale), slow_boss_scale. gravity_staff: mage relic of floor 4 (ball replaces the attack: damage x weapon, pull radius/strength px; wall: key, length, thickness px, time s; bar: drawn with the right mouse, max_length px, lasts time s, holds shots for hold s). sounds: game event -> audio_sfx.json event (\"\" = the skill's own sound). music: play the music states. gravity_staff short: slot label under the skill bar. relics: random relic shrine per run on one of floors (in their secret room), the relic from the hero class's pool (none = no shrine), sealed by four plates stepped in order. gravity_staff / gravity_hammer: class relics; attack (ball / hammer swing) replaces the weapon and is stronger; skills on keys 1-4 open at their level (unlock) with cooldowns and values. cards: level-up upgrade cards per class, relic and 'all' (max = how often; values are shares, e.g. damage 0.15 = +15 %); three are offered per level-up. styled_hud: framed banner, mission list, status sheet (C / Tab) and level-up cards (src/hell/frost_hud.gd). relics.drop boss: the relic lies in a chest the guardian of the relic floor drops. shadow_dagger: archer relic (melee stab with backstab x2 on enemies not facing you; shadow step through up to hits enemies, blade cyclone around you, smoke bomb = enemies lose you and slow, thousand blades = blade rain on an area). sounds: master skills use their own. talents: the talent trees and soul crystals file (assets/data/frost_talents.json); master_cooldown: s for the key 5 master skill. world_pack: the world kit builds every floor live from the run number (src/world_kit/world_core.gd + world_pack.gd, pack assets/data/frost_world.json from tools/frost_dungeon/frost_world.js); a new run rolls a new world, saves keep its number; the baked frost_floors.json is no longer read. world_sizes: the HD manifest, so both graphics sets build the same floor. skins: the Pixel / HD sets (src/core/graphics_settings.gd): pixel = assets/sprites/frost, hd = assets/sprites/frost_hd (tools/frost_dungeon/build_frost_extras.py). vault_closed / vault_open: the giant vault chest before and after opening. plate_hint false: the plates do not show their order. No mimic chests: the Frostgruft has no mimic.",
